          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "منذ زمن طويل — mundhu zaman ṭawīl — \"long ago; for a long time\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "منذ زمن طويل كانت هنا غابة كبيرة. mundhu zaman ṭawīl kānat hunā ghāba kabīra. Long ago there was a big forest here."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It opens a story set in the past, or says how long a thing has lasted."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
