          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "منذ زمن طويل (mundhu zaman ṭawīl) is \"since a long time\": the taught mundhu, \"since\", with zaman, built on the native Arabic root z-m-n (Lane), and ṭawīl, long."
            }
          ]
        },
